{"attempt":1,"diagnostics":[],"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","feedback":["CRITIC DIAGNOSTIC REPAIR: Repair the raw candidate's object boundaries. It ends with an unclosed outer object; appending one closing brace makes JSON parsing succeed but exposes misplaced nesting: solve is inside symbols.aggregate, and predicates, theorems, obligations, witness_obligations, and native_requirements are inside symbols. Close aggregate before solve and close symbols before predicates, preserving the existing AST contents, so solve is a sibling of aggregate and the remaining sections are top-level fields. Serialize the complete corrected object and rerun parsing and type checking before behavioral evaluation."],"milestone_authority":false,"phase":"formalize","results":[{"agent":"critic","checked":null,"instance":"critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1","proposal":{"corrections":[{"artifact":"formalization.json","diagnostic_index":0,"explanation":"Repair the raw candidate's object boundaries. It ends with an unclosed outer object; appending one closing brace makes JSON parsing succeed but exposes misplaced nesting: solve is inside symbols.aggregate, and predicates, theorems, obligations, witness_obligations, and native_requirements are inside symbols. Close aggregate before solve and close symbols before predicates, preserving the existing AST contents, so solve is a sibling of aggregate and the remaining sections are top-level fields. Serialize the complete corrected object and rerun parsing and type checking before behavioral evaluation."}],"counterexamples":[],"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR"},"status":"REPAIR","tier":"R0"}],"status":"REPAIR","tiers":[{"abstains":0,"accepts":0,"blocking_findings":["critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1"],"members":1,"missing":[],"reasons":["unresolved blocking findings veto: critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1"],"rejects":1,"result":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","tier":"R0"}]}